--- Demonstrating exhaustiveness gap ---
Caught: Unknown node type: Call
A match with no wildcard arm would be a silent no-op in Python.
ML compilers warn at compile time - Python warns only at runtime.

--- Guard patterns (match + if) ---
  categorize(-3) = -3 is negative
  categorize(0) = zero
